    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Add Client Cards" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Client Card</p>
            <p>Creates a new card for an individual client with faker data</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker card number (visa), full name, MMYY expiry, external reference</p>
            <step>Load individual client from fixture and navigate to newest client</step>
            <step>Open Cards page, click Add, fill form (cardNumber, cardholder, expiry, externalReference, account)</step>
            <step>Save the card</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Card is saved successfully and appears in the grid</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
